OL,3,ARayner defends pause to local council
OL,4,Aoverhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe surprise announcement on Monday has
OL,7,Fthrown the reorganisation plans into
OL,8,Fdoubt, and drawn criticism from local
OL,9,Fleaders preparing for the changes.
